      "records": [
        {
          "body": "[P2] Include calculation and receipt writes in the stage timer\n\nThe protocol defines stage-wall time to include calculation, serialization, and final receipt fsync, but this value is captured before the frozen calculator runs and before its receipt is written. A run close to the wall-time limit can therefore pass the `stage_wall` resource check even though its protocol-defined elapsed time exceeds the limit. Measure the complete required interval before deciding the gate.",
